Subject: CPMS I02C Canonical Document and Golden Bundle Formation Justification

@ [justification_uuid] 78a8db04-a464-46fd-bccc-13c1da5e3e72

& [SelectedSelfContainedDocuments] make every local reference inspectable without external resolution
& [RejectedSharedCrossDirectionDocument] would erase Deserialize versus Serialize identity
& [SelectedManifestMetadata] avoids nonstandard keywords inside canonical JSON Schema
& [SelectedUnsignedPayloadDigest] avoids a self-referential bundle hash
& [SelectedPureArtifactMap] permits golden proof without runtime filesystem authority
& [SelectedExactBaselineOnly] gives later compatibility work a stable input without pretending changed schemas are already proven compatible
& [RejectedImplementationNow] would bypass source preservation, SJS review, canonical hash, and a separate activation lock
